Z||000008||jch82||09-23-2001||05:51 PM||||Dave: LoL   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Fierowrecker: I did cut behind the radiator for extra air flow and to prevent my headlights from "operating" at high speeds....<P>Andy: The sway bar worked out fine. Ken and I had to flip it over because apparently there is an up and a down....Who would have thought??   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Formula: Anyone with minor bodywork experience could do it. All it takes is patience....<P>Josh   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jch82_1.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by jch82 (edited 09-30-2001).]||||reg||1
