Z||000017||jch82||09-25-2001||03:07 PM||||Fiero: So is that the fiero you bought?? What are you going to do with the warber hood now???<P>sqoach: I will take a pic from the side today and post it later on tonight when I get on....I think the best view is from the drivers seat. Makes my little baby look so buff!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>As for the nose, when I bought it, the guy before ran into a trailer hitch and there was about a 5" crack down the middle. I patched it up with SEM flexible parts repair. <P>falconhulk: Not a stupid question....before I got the scoop I actually wondered that too.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> All I did was cut out a hole just behind the radiator. There is an oval sunk in (hope that makes sense) that is a perfect cut-out for it.<P>Josh   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jch82_1.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by jch82 (edited 09-30-2001).]||||reg||7
